    {
      "id": "lcnabf",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The governing design values are in [](#ref:lcrfvs): the highest combination of each set is picked automatically, and _set_ chooses between expression (6.10) and expressions (6.10a) and (6.10b) as the national annex requires. Change the actions or the factors in [](#ref:lcwhfn) and every value follows.",
      "at": [0, 186]
