    {"id": "lcgfvh", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Design basis", "at": [0, 261]},
    {
      "id": "lcsbjr",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Effects of one permanent and two independent variable actions on one member, all of the same sign, so the permanent action is always unfavourable. Each variable action is taken as leading in turn. National annex values are taken as the recommended values (EN 1990, Tables A1.1 and A1.2(B)).",
      "at": [0, 293]
    },
